v6.1 -- Undo/Redo
  * Add an Edit menu with Undo (Ctrl+Z) and Redo (Ctrl+Y) items
    (devsimpy/Menu.py) wired to the canvas history.
  * Harden the snapshot-based undo/redo engine of ShapeCanvas
    (devsimpy/Container.py): correct baseline, proper redo invalidation
    on new edits, dynamic history depth (NB_HISTORY_UNDO).
  * Record additional operations: delete, paste, move (arrows/drag),
    lock/unlock, enable/disable, connection and attribute edits.
  * Fix the keyboard shortcuts (Ctrl+Z / Ctrl+Y / Ctrl+Shift+Z) and add
    undo/redo support to detached frames.
  * Add tests/test_undo_redo.py.

v6.0, March 14 2025 -- Finale release.
